WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.390
Ayanami! Are you okay?!

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:17.350
Ayanami!

00:00:28.737 --> 00:00:34.367
Don't say... Don't say that you
don't have anything else, okay?

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:40.707
Don't say sad stuff like "Farewell"
whenever you walk off, okay?

00:00:57.849 --> 00:00:59.184
Why are you crying?

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:04.481
I'm sorry.

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:08.026
I don't know how I should act
at times like this.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.821
Smiling would be a good start.

